ADDITIONAL NOTICE - NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE

This software emits informational trade *signals* for human review. It holds no
exchange trading credential, cannot place, cancel, modify or close any order,
cannot change leverage and cannot move funds. It performs no automated
execution of any kind.

Nothing it produces is investment advice, a recommendation, or a solicitation
to trade. Crypto derivatives are high-risk instruments that can result in the
loss of all capital. Market data may be incomplete, delayed or wrong, and any
performance figure produced by the bundled backtester or walk-forward tooling
is a historical simulation that does not predict future results. You are solely
responsible for every order you place. Use at your own risk.
